    <p><strong>Methodology:</strong> CAGR calculated using the standard formula (End/Start)^(1/years) – 1. Annualized volatility computed as standard deviation of daily log returns multiplied by √252. Drawdown measured as peak-to-trough percentage decline in closing price. Report generated {meta['generated']}.</p>
